---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms of Service | DumpsterGrid" 
  description="Terms of Service and platform use agreements for DumpsterGrid. Learn about our role as a referral middleware network, permit requirements, and hauler liability."
>
  <section class="relative py-24 px-6 overflow-hidden min-h-[80vh] flex items-center">
    
    <!-- Ambient Glows -->
    <div class="ambient-glow-amber w-[400px] h-[400px] -top-10 -left-10 animate-pulse-slow"></div>
    <div class="ambient-glow-blue w-[400px] h-[400px] -bottom-10 -right-10 animate-pulse-slow"></div>
    
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full relative z-10 space-y-8">
      
      <!-- Page Header -->
      <div class="text-center space-y-3">
        <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-500/10 border border-brand-500/25 text-brand-600 font-display font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">
          📋 Compliance Documents
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-display font-extrabold text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
          Terms of Service
        </h1>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest">
          Last Updated: May 29, 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Legal Body (Obsidian Glass Card) -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-slate-200 shadow-xl">
        
        <p class="text-base text-slate-800 font-medium">
          Welcome to DumpsterGrid. By accessing our website, using our dynamic quote matching wizards, or communicating with our dispatch system, you agree to be bound by the following Terms of Service.
        </p>

        <hr class="border-slate-100" />

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg">1. Acceptance of Terms</h3>
          <p>
            By entering your zip code and completing a request through the DumpsterGrid quote wizard, you explicitly agree to these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, you must immediately discontinue using our matching services.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg">2. Scope of Service (Referral Network)</h3>
          <p>
            DumpsterGrid operates purely as an <strong>informational directory and dynamic referral middleware platform</strong>. 
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-slate-500">
            <li>We do not own, operate, or lease waste management trucks, dumpsters, or roll-off bins.</li>
            <li>We do not personally collect, haul, process, or dispose of construction debris, household trash, or hazardous waste.</li>
            <li>All quote matches connect you directly with independent, certified third-party waste hauling contractors in your local municipality or county. All hauling contracts, delivery schedules, and billing cycles are established directly between you and the matched hauler.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg">3. User Responsibilities & Permitting</h3>
          <p>
            When booking a dumpster through our referral system, you are solely responsible for:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-slate-500">
            <li>Providing accurate site dimensions, location drop points, and project specifications.</li>
            <li>Obtaining any necessary **Right-of-Way (ROW) placement permits** from your local public works department if the dumpster is slated for a street, sidewalk, or public easement.</li>
            <li>Ensuring that the delivery area is free of overhead tree limbs, low wires, or vehicle obstructions, and that the ground surface is sturdy enough to support the vehicle and bin weight.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg">4. Consent to Communications</h3>
          <p>
            By submitting a quote request, you authorize DumpsterGrid and its matched local dispatch partners to contact you via telephone calls, automated emails, or SMS text messages to verify project specifications, deliver pricing sheets, or coordinate drop-offs. Standard messaging and data rates may apply. You may opt out of dispatch communications at any time.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg">5. Limitation of Liability</h3>
          <p>
            DumpsterGrid is provided on an "as-is" and "as-available" basis without warranty of any kind. 
          </p>
          <p>
            To the maximum extent permitted by law, DumpsterGrid, its developers, and officers shall not be held liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use of our referral system, including but not limited to: driveway/property damage caused by matched hauler trucks, project delays, local zoning fines, or disputes with independent hauling contractors.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg">6. Changes to Terms</h3>
          <p>
            We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time without prior notification. Your continued use of the DumpsterGrid platform following the posting of modifications indicates complete acceptance of the updated terms.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg">7. Governing Law</h3>
          <p>
            These terms are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Texas, without giving effect to any principles of conflict of laws.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg">8. Customer Support</h3>
          <p>
            For questions regarding these Terms of Service or to submit platform feedback, please call our national dispatch service directly at <strong>1-800-508-4000</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
